# SHA256 manifest for BONSAI-MLX-PENDING-ORGANIZER.
# Revision: BONSAI-MLX-PENDING-ORGANIZER
#
# The MTP HEAD for track bonsai2-9b-mlx-v1. PENDING: no MTP head is published
# for the Bonsai 2 9B pack. The head is a qwen3_5_mtp layer for the Qwen 3.5 9B
# geometry. When one is published, this file pins it unmodified: nothing here
# re-quantizes, mirrors or re-uploads it. If the pack ships its own mtp.*
# block, the head comes from the target manifest and this file names that.
#
# setup-mtp-head.sh refuses this manifest while it carries the sentinel.
